		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Psychic, blue-skinned derro sorcerer. Short, dwarf-like, adorned with arcane foci.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13 (leather), <strong>HP</strong> 14, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 staff +1 (1d4) or 1 spell +4, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> -1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> -3, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Babble (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 12. Focus. One target in near of LV 4 or less is confused, rants madly and acts randomly.</p><p></p><p><strong>Hallucination (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 14. Focus. All sentient targets within near suffer visions, DISADV on rolls.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pall of Madness</strong>. Immune to charm, sleep, and other mental effects.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sunlight Allergy</strong>. Takes 1d6 damage per round in direct sunlight.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
